# <type>(<optional scope>): <summary>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, test, refactor, perf, build, ci, chore
# Scopes: adf2md, md2adf, cli, packaging
#
# Examples:
#   feat(adf2md): add support for media nodes
#   fix(cli): exit nonzero when the input file is missing
#   docs: document conventional commit style
#
# Body: what changed and why. Wrap at 72 characters.
# Breaking change: type! or a BREAKING CHANGE: footer.
